PIPER KERNEL
the piper kernel is the base source code of viper os that you can use to develop your own pico os 
it has basic file system commands like ld and rf
it also has core import and variables from viper os
and in order to use it you download it rename it from kernel.py to main.py and then load it into a code editor and do what you wish with it save it and put it onto your pi pico's flash storage
